a routine with no Tensorize is labeled not-requested: true
a routine with no Tensorize does not read as tensorized: true
the routine's summary is what a bracket around the same compile collects: true
an honoured Tensorize is labeled tensorized: true
a declined Tensorize is labeled scalar-fallback: true
a declined Tensorize does not read as tensorized despite the schedule asking: true
no statements is not-requested: true
all statements declined is scalar-fallback: true
every non-fallback rendering counts as tensorized: true
a partly declined routine is tensorized with a nonzero fallback count: true
a nested bracket summarizes only its own entries: true
an enclosing bracket observes the entries of a nested one: true
a completed bracket leaves the census global as it found it: true
a report with no crowned candidate carries no tensorization label: true
a report with no crowned candidate does not render as tensorized: true
